# Email

- **Provider**: [Spacemail](https://www.spacemail.com) (`www.spacemail.com`)
- **Domain**: `zublo.co`
- **Primary contact address**: `contact@zublo.co`

When updating email references, contact forms, or DNS/MX guidance:

- Use `contact@zublo.co` on the site and in form notification config
- Do not use legacy `hello@smartermarketing.com` addresses
- Assume mailbox and DNS are managed through Spacemail unless the user says otherwise
